    "enUS": {
      "description": "Greetings, {class}. I imagine I can guess what has brought you to my stables today.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for a mount, you have come to the right place. Be warned though, riding an undead steed is not for the faint of heart.\r\n\r\nAs such, you have an important choice to make. You and your undead steed will travel the world together for good or ill. Fear not, whatever choice you make will be the correct one.\r\n\r\nGo examine the undead horses and return to me when you have made your choice.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Red Skeletal Horse",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
